{"id": "port-embarcadero-percentage-rent-overcharge", "title": "The Port overcharged a waterfront tenant $57,390", "seconds": 43.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "120d6349c3d52ec5", "words": 136, "beats": [{"scene": "formula", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A Rincon Park restaurant lease required both base rent and participation rent.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.08, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Did", "the", "Port", "collect", "too", "much", "rent?"], "sub": "Rincon Park restaurants"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.46, 0.76, 1.2, 1.52, 1.93, 2.16, 2.45, 2.73, 2.99, 3.69]}, {"scene": "formula", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Auditors found the tenant complied with its revenue reporting obligation.", "t0": 4.2, "t1": 7.76, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "Lease audit", "mark": "Lease audit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.55, 0.83, 0.94, 1.3, 1.73, 1.89, 2.06, 2.44, 2.85]}, {"scene": "formula", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The tenant paid over a million dollars in rent from 2018 through 2021.", "t0": 7.88, "t1": 11.75, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,145,604", "label": "Rent paid from 2018 through 2021"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.36, 0.57, 0.78, 0.85, 1.14, 1.48, 1.59, 1.87, 2.05, 2.34, 2.8, 3.02, 3.25]}, {"scene": "formula", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In February 2018 the Port should have increased the break-even point.", "t0": 11.87, "t1": 15.38, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "February 2018 threshold", "mark": "February 2018 threshold"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.6, 0.84, 1.63, 1.78, 2.02, 2.19, 2.31, 2.67, 2.76, 3.25]}, {"scene": "formula", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The tenant continued reporting with the old threshold.", "t0": 15.5, "t1": 17.76, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Rent calculation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.39, 0.78, 1.21, 1.37, 1.48, 1.66]}, {"scene": "formula", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "That unchanged threshold accounted for $55,746 in overpayments.", "t0": 17.88, "t1": 23.05, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$55,746", "label": "Overpayment from the old threshold"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.84, 1.38, 1.79, 1.94, 2.46, 2.9, 3.18, 3.43, 3.89, 4.3, 4.43]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "March 2020 added another $1,644.", "t0": 23.27, "t1": 27.13, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Two adjustments", "heading": "How the audit reached its total", "source": "audit", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Old threshold", "value": "$55,746"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "March 2020", "value": "$1,644"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.56, 0.95, 1.24, 1.58, 1.8, 2.31, 2.54, 2.83, 3.31]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In total, the Port collected $57,390 too much.", "t0": 27.25, "t1": 30.91, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$57,390", "label": "Rent overpaid"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.46, 0.57, 0.78, 1.16, 1.68, 2.04, 2.26, 2.55, 2.83, 3.14, 3.27]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Port agreed to credit future rent and reconcile the account annually.", "t0": 31.03, "t1": 34.26, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "Port response", "mark": "Port response"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.33, 0.65, 0.74, 1.05, 1.4, 1.67, 1.84, 2.32, 2.42, 2.73]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Controller later listed the recommendations as closed.", "t0": 34.38, "t1": 36.9, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "followup", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "April 2026 follow-up", "mark": "April 2026 follow-up"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.56, 0.8, 1.09, 1.2, 1.87, 1.99]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The closure summary does not say when or how much credit was posted.", "t0": 37.02, "t1": 40.16, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Credit posting date", "Balance applied"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.5, 0.84, 1.0, 1.19, 1.43, 1.68, 1.82, 1.98, 2.18, 2.47, 2.61]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 40.28, "t1": 42.42, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"formula": "Which threshold did the Port use?", "credit": "Was the credit posted?"}, "look": "map", "hook": "question"}